    "detailed_description": "<strong>Catch Fish! Catch Men!</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overview</h2><br>Otokonoko Fishing is a unique double fishing action game where you can enjoy two types of fishing in one game! Fish in rivers and seas, and &quot;fish&quot; for men on land by cross-dressing.<br>Enhance your fishing gear and outfits to aim for fishing grounds where the strongest monster fish dwell!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game System \u2460: Fishing</h2><br>Experience high-speed fishing action as you race through fishing grounds!<br>Spot your prey and aim with your hookshot!<br>Push or pull? Outsmart the fish in a battle of wits and reel them in!<br>Be careful of jump ramps and spiked clubs that are common in fishing grounds!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563920/extras/7153aba905a20c5a20d010d0cbc1f186.poster.avif?t=1740819004\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563920/extras/7153aba905a20c5a20d010d0cbc1f186.webm?t=1740819004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563920/extras/7153aba905a20c5a20d010d0cbc1f186.mp4?t=1740819004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game System \u2461: Crafting</h2><br>Collect materials by stripping caught fish or picking them up in fishing grounds!<br>The residents of the port town will craft useful items for you!<br>Craft powerful fishing gear, snacks for the fishing grounds,<br>rainbow coffee, self-affirmation, and more to progress advantageously in the game!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563920/extras/4ed7d6e1e9523ee7a6d6c7d99fd5c2cc.poster.avif?t=1740819004\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563920/extras/4ed7d6e1e9523ee7a6d6c7d99fd5c2cc.webm?t=1740819004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563920/extras/4ed7d6e1e9523ee7a6d6c7d99fd5c2cc.mp4?t=1740819004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game System \u2462: Catching Men</h2><br>Having trouble collecting crafting materials? Time to cross-dress!<br>We have a full range of outfits like maid costumes, Chinese dresses, cheerleader outfits, and more.<br>Charm those who propose outrageous rates and haggle, haggle, haggle! 95% off!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563920/extras/c68c68f58cce3542c831b5fb1cfffcda.poster.avif?t=1740819004\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563920/extras/c68c68f58cce3542c831b5fb1cfffcda.webm?t=1740819004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2563920/extras/c68c68f58cce3542c831b5fb1cfffcda.mp4?t=1740819004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game System \u2463: Expanding Fishing Grounds</h2><br>Crafting fishing gear expands your range of action.<br>Eventually, you\u2019ll be able to fish at night and even head out to sea!<br>Defeat fish that release poison, fish that emit electric shocks, and fish that release both poison and electric shocks,<br>and aim for fishing grounds where the strongest monster fish dwell!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playtime</h2><br>Approximately 3 hours<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Video Distribution Guidelines</h2><br>You may stream without permission.<br>You may stream all areas of the game.<br>Individuals and those affiliated with corporations can stream.<br>Monetized content is allowed.<br>We would appreciate it if you mention the game title in your video title.<br>We would appreciate it if you include a link to the store page in the description (or equivalent).<br>We are not responsible for any damages resulting from the posting or streaming of content.<br>These guidelines are subject to change without notice.",
